    <string name="canned_2">Ni nga rumela tshifanyiso tsha sikirini kana zwiṅwe zwidodombedzwa zwa thaidzo?</string>
    <string name="canned_3">Ndi khou humbela ni thome hafhu tshishumiswa tshaṋu ni ri divhadze arali thaidzo i tshi bvela phanḓa.</string>
