    <string name="faq_1_title">Ndo hangwa phasiwedi yanga</string>
    <string name="faq_1_body">Kha sikirini ya u dzhena pfuka \"Wo hangwa phasiwedi?\", dzhenisani imeili yaṋu, fhindulani mbudziso ya tsireledzo ni nange phasiwedi ntswa. Arali akhaunthi yaṋu i si na mbudziso ya tsireledzo, humbelani muṱoni u i dzudzanya hafhu.</string>
    <string name="faq_2_title">Ndi rumela thikithi hani?</string>
    <string name="faq_2_body">Pfukani batani ya + kha bugwe ḽaṋu, dzhenisani tshiṱoho na ṱhaluso, nangani murafho na ndeme (app i a ṱuṱuwedza) ni ṋee faela arali i tshi thusa. Ni pfuke u rumela.</string>
    <string name="faq_3_title">Thikithi yanga i do shumiwa lini?</string>
    <string name="faq_3_body">Tshifhinga tshi ya nga ndeme: Ya Ndeme Ṱhoṱhi awara dza 4, Nṱha awara dza 24, Vhukati awara dza 72, Fhasi awara dza 120. Thikithi dzo fhiraho tshifhinga dzi vhonadzwa kha tshiṱirathe tsha thuso.</string>
    <string name="faq_4_title">Wi-Fi kana VPN yanga i dzula i tshi kagwa</string>
    <string name="faq_4_body">Thomani hafhu tshishumiswa, ni hangwe ni dzhenele hafhu netiweke ya Wi-Fi, ni vusuludze app ya VPN. Arali i tshi kagwa, rumelani thikithi kha murafho wa Netiweke.</string>
    <string name="faq_5_title">Khomphiyutha yanga i a dzhiela</string>
    <string name="faq_5_body">I thomeni hafhu, valani app dzine na si dzi shumise, vhulunganyani vhupo ha tshiṱoro ni dzhenise zwivhumbeo zwiswa. Arali i tshi dzhiela, rumelani thikithi ya Hardware kana Software.</string>
    <string name="faq_6_title">Ndi ṋea thikithi muya kana u vhona histori yayo hani?</string>
    <string name="faq_6_body">Vulani thikithi kha bugwe ḽaṋu. Histori i sumbedza u shanduka ha vhuimo na u ṋewa. Musi thikithi i tshi tandululwa, muthu we a i vula a nga ṋea nyeredzi dza 1 u ya kha dza 5.</string>
